# Strapi Production News — Tenant, Categories, and Naming

## Problem (symptoms)

- Production news page shows **“No articles”** while local works.
- **Tenant filter** returns 0 when published rows lack `articles_tenant_lnk` (draft may have tenant; published does not).
- **Category sections empty** when production slugs are `Main-News` but frontend filters `main-news`.

## Root causes

1. **Strapi 5 Draft & Publish**: draft and published are separate DB rows; **relation link tables are not always copied on publish**.
2. **Category slug casing**: UID fields stored with wrong casing break `filters[category][slug][$eq]=main-news`.

## Enforcement (code — requires Strapi Cloud deploy)

| Layer | File | Behavior |
|-------|------|----------|
| Article lifecycles | [`src/api/article/content-types/article/lifecycles.js`](mdc:src/api/article/content-types/article/lifecycles.js) | `beforeCreate` / `beforeUpdate`: assign tenant from editor-tenant mapping |
| Slug lifecycles + middleware | [`src/utils/normalize-slug.js`](mdc:src/utils/normalize-slug.js), per-type `lifecycles.js`, [`src/bootstrap.js`](mdc:src/bootstrap.js) | All UID `slug` fields → lowercase kebab-case on save; optional `STRICT_KEBAB_SLUG=1` rejects invalid slugs with a validation error |
| Publish middleware | [`src/bootstrap.js`](mdc:src/bootstrap.js) `registerTenantPublishMiddleware()` | **Before** publish: ensure draft has tenant; **after** publish: copy tenant link to published row |
| Shared helpers | [`src/utils/tenant-assignment.js`](mdc:src/utils/tenant-assignment.js) | Editor→tenant resolution, link-table ensure/copy |
| Editor RBAC | [`src/bootstrap.js`](mdc:src/bootstrap.js) `registerTenantDocumentMiddleware()` | Tenant-scoped find/update for editor role |

**Tenant-scoped UIDs** (publish middleware): article, advertisement-slot, flash-news-item, directory-home, and all directory collection types listed in `registerTenantPublishMiddleware`.

## One-time Cloud repair (no new deploy required for endpoint)

Uses existing **`POST /api/migration/fix-published`** in [`src/index.js`](mdc:src/index.js):

```json
{
  "tenantDocumentId": "<tenant documentId from /api/tenants>",
  "articles": [{ "documentId": "...", "uid": "api::article.article" }]
}
```

Auth: `Authorization: Bearer` = `STRAPI_CLOUD_API_TOKEN` or `STRAPI_MIGRATION_TOKEN`.

